{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-a68013c8-4630-41c6-a5ee-a658b57f58fe", "text": "淮上喜會梁川故人\n韋應物\n江漢曾爲客，相逢每醉還。\n浮雲一別後，流水十年間。\n歡笑情如舊，蕭疎鬢已斑。\n何因北歸去，淮上對秋山。", "title": "淮上喜會梁川故人", "author": "韋應物", "paragraphs": ["江漢曾爲客，相逢每醉還。", "浮雲一別後，流水十年間。", "歡笑情如舊，蕭疎鬢已斑。", "何因北歸去，淮上對秋山。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "友情", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 331, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "6b24ec3f67c36ab27b7e2228d630923fa1088238a230852157399fb2bea985c4", "family": "620ab496275d5037daf7480d58d36e4edd869d81de31878fe387b3c779de9f82"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-e4a87504-f9a3-4599-b770-aba4afd3cb04", "text": "雜曲歌辭 渭城曲\n王維\n謂城朝雨浥輕塵，客舍青青柳色春。\n勸君更盡一杯酒，西出陽關無故人。", "title": "雜曲歌辭 渭城曲", "author": "王維", "paragraphs": ["謂城朝雨浥輕塵，客舍青青柳色春。", "勸君更盡一杯酒，西出陽關無故人。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "八年级下册(课外)", "友情", "小学古诗", "送别", "初中古诗", "乐府", "近代曲辞", "四年级上册"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 260, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "5e5e77bdc95897763e2cc87b5ef23d75830bacca588f89cee36e33ea93799e0c", "family": "52a05fb47e982aa91f043d050bf7cc9701e1c47b3c666d50f0adeaf253963d2c"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-94ae3e7e-eb5d-414c-bfd6-124f50687ce5", "text": "客夜與故人偶集\n戴叔倫\n天秋月又滿，城闕夜千重。\n還作江南會，翻疑夢裏逢。\n風枝驚暗鵲，露草覆寒蛩。\n羈旅長堪醉，相留畏曉鐘。", "title": "客夜與故人偶集", "author": "戴叔倫", "paragraphs": ["天秋月又滿，城闕夜千重。", "還作江南會，翻疑夢裏逢。", "風枝驚暗鵲，露草覆寒蛩。", "羈旅長堪醉，相留畏曉鐘。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "友情", "写景", "秋天", "五言律诗", "相聚"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 125, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "0df12c9ed82beb6adbaf1b6aa5cd66eea184f7599a93f56407b39d74afd68dff", "family": "8d627eb7fa99db8e4725cdd966e32ba34b0081785678ac5f3051f7f24cbbb1de"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-670009c2-a701-4140-aa31-b4973f76d632", "text": "隋宮\n李商隱\n紫泉宮殿鎖煙霞，欲取蕪城作帝家。\n玉璽不緣歸日角，錦帆應是到天涯。\n于今腐草無螢火，終古垂楊有暮鴉。\n地下若逢陳後主，豈宜重問後庭花。", "title": "隋宮", "author": "李商隱", "paragraphs": ["紫泉宮殿鎖煙霞，欲取蕪城作帝家。", "玉璽不緣歸日角，錦帆應是到天涯。", "于今腐草無螢火，終古垂楊有暮鴉。", "地下若逢陳後主，豈宜重問後庭花。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "隋・唐・五代", "七言律诗", "讽刺", "咏史"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 16, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "a0f65ec76d1ecd897992c32bdc8ecfe351fe5d07a45f301436ceaca40cff6c7a", "family": "918136df077fc8e19790d2c19f1477c63c07cb0f7282fa1c48de20d8405aff60"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-4fa92777-9bd6-45ca-9272-bac30459cf5e", "text": "金陵五題 烏衣巷\n劉禹錫\n朱雀橋邊野草花，烏衣巷口夕陽斜。\n舊時王謝堂前燕，飛入尋常百姓家。", "title": "金陵五題 烏衣巷", "author": "劉禹錫", "paragraphs": ["朱雀橋邊野草花，烏衣巷口夕陽斜。", "舊時王謝堂前燕，飛入尋常百姓家。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "怀古", "七言绝句", "带有地名", "地名"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 268, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "e75703d2e9f2936745034556e34c105e954655bc7856ee6de8a0fc3630176938", "family": "443f1f285a01718b1d01cd4576761117ec358d73a2a1f1df1161832fb8a330ba"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-51262a8c-de53-41ee-958a-de08d5f5a446", "text": "集靈臺二首 二\n張祜\n虢國夫人承主恩，平明騎馬入宮門。\n却嫌脂粉汚顏色，淡掃蛾眉朝至尊。", "title": "集靈臺二首 二", "author": "張祜", "paragraphs": ["虢國夫人承主恩，平明騎馬入宮門。", "却嫌脂粉汚顏色，淡掃蛾眉朝至尊。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "写人", "七言绝句", "讽刺"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 195, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "a7fe4d743ee0097ccda065fffdd8da9d353644ddc149c7f9acaf179f3a8760ac", "family": "90864cb65dda49fa4fa019fcc4ef860a15b7025fe5aaf7ebd647ce631396dc88"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-469dec8b-ba5e-4faf-b52f-2ad203e38d81", "text": "溪居\n柳宗元\n久爲簪組累，幸此南夷謫。\n閑依農圃鄰，偶似山林客。\n曉耕翻露草，夜榜響溪石。\n來往不逢人，長歌楚天碧。", "title": "溪居", "author": "柳宗元", "paragraphs": ["久爲簪組累，幸此南夷謫。", "閑依農圃鄰，偶似山林客。", "曉耕翻露草，夜榜響溪石。", "來往不逢人，長歌楚天碧。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "孤独", "五言古诗", "生活"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 202, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "7aa0ad0e2529ebdab977504b4499cfdbba45b208309ccc54a8713033d2c23006", "family": "aa8a92d6db2cc414f89b1f3d828052f24b1b496e902b2316c7631fa4dc841631"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-a6144ae0-3bcf-4503-b58d-9abf24d6608c", "text": "渡漢江\n李頻\n嶺外音書絕，經年復歷春。\n近鄉情更怯，不敢問來人。", "title": "渡漢江", "author": "李頻", "paragraphs": ["嶺外音書絕，經年復歷春。", "近鄉情更怯，不敢問來人。"], "tags": ["五言绝句", "思乡", "唐诗三百首", "渡江"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 187, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "6cb3df8be1ce309a24f7283931786752a666e79461338444aa9da9fd5d31b43f", "family": "e39403d27025b50b98469cef7769ff2edfb64c3567f9c3e1ba72560c844e5798"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-1f83fccf-7476-464b-8cd4-8a2b4569c7a0", "text": "送友人\n李白\n青山橫北郭，白水遶東城。\n此地一爲別，孤蓬萬里征。\n浮雲遊子意，落日故人情。\n揮手自茲去，蕭蕭班馬鳴。", "title": "送友人", "author": "李白", "paragraphs": ["青山橫北郭，白水遶東城。", "此地一爲別，孤蓬萬里征。", "浮雲遊子意，落日故人情。", "揮手自茲去，蕭蕭班馬鳴。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "八年级上册(课外)", "友情", "写景", "送别", "五言律诗", "初中古诗", "惜别"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 322, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "ba7422a20752dc58cd2304f70a9a0f317f436a2a257d1d755d01472930593c71", "family": "e18a9bbceeee04be7fcac7c5cc128273ced28f29e4ed533752e20616f25c685d"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-12fdaad8-b197-4526-b56d-c7c713267248", "text": "望嶽\n杜甫\n岱宗夫如何，齊魯青未了。\n造化鍾神秀，陰陽割昏曉。\n盪胷生曾雲，決眥入歸鳥。\n會當凌絕頂，一覽衆山小。", "title": "望嶽", "author": "杜甫", "paragraphs": ["岱宗夫如何，齊魯青未了。", "造化鍾神秀，陰陽割昏曉。", "盪胷生曾雲，決眥入歸鳥。", "會當凌絕頂，一覽衆山小。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "泰山", "五言古诗", "励志", "写景", "初中古诗", "山", "哲理", "八年级上册(课内)", "写鸟", "写山", "描写山", "鸟"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 240, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "35ee9c172b4201a14315b9f9c80f17f1c6a4fc0d97c664bb07d8cc07546f4b9e", "family": "298d739e6fe410019f0bb8c175aebeac7945e0b36f48976a0a19074ca32f11a3"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-0613f575-4f07-4326-8591-603fb3d1da45", "text": "秦中感秋寄遠上人\n孟浩然\n一丘常欲臥，三徑苦無資。\n北土非吾願，東林懷我師。\n黃金然桂盡，壯志逐年衰。\n日夕涼風至，聞蟬但益悲。", "title": "秦中感秋寄遠上人", "author": "孟浩然", "paragraphs": ["一丘常欲臥，三徑苦無資。", "北土非吾願，東林懷我師。", "黃金然桂盡，壯志逐年衰。", "日夕涼風至，聞蟬但益悲。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "归隐", "抒情", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 111, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "3077df2d24ee833e3e86969e4a61925bbe3ca8cf84e9860c95fb5f1c00d54c7d", "family": "f1bc411ae547ae21c014af0c8e39757bcf16f37fc6b46903244c24ee2217eb23"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-7c93c162-d424-4d91-b71b-7c9b81713b8c", "text": "赤壁\n杜牧\n折戟沈沙鐵未銷，自將磨洗認前朝。\n東風不與周郎便，銅雀春深鏁二喬。", "title": "赤壁", "author": "杜牧", "paragraphs": ["折戟沈沙鐵未銷，自將磨洗認前朝。", "東風不與周郎便，銅雀春深鏁二喬。"], "tags": ["隋・唐・五代", "战争", "八年级下册(课内)", "唐诗三百首", "初中古诗", "七言绝句", "咏史怀古", "怀才不遇"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 72, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "747913d4236e4c2487fa8f030d09b3e8343894699d4902b0b6031979e0339603", "family": "dc5726f075562252e15848e5de050cd005e7672d20236030d181a582311f3682"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-c854a853-b015-4848-823b-a786659d33b3", "text": "宿王昌齡隱居\n常建\n清溪深不測，隱處唯孤雲。\n松際露微月，清光猶爲君。\n茅亭宿花影，藥院滋苔紋。\n余亦謝時去，西山鸞鶴羣。", "title": "宿王昌齡隱居", "author": "常建", "paragraphs": ["清溪深不測，隱處唯孤雲。", "松際露微月，清光猶爲君。", "茅亭宿花影，藥院滋苔紋。", "余亦謝時去，西山鸞鶴羣。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "隐逸", "五言古诗", "山水"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 172, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "8fae8b6bd56c13276b24f2465d0eb852062acb96f427b4aae56f1ed6124d9a39", "family": "6e46a57947e051f35902056c93d55ee899db5665d9fdd36a6e4c01eb6a8739ae"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-0f5874bf-3748-44c9-bc3a-be4a8c3eb2f6", "text": "閣夜\n杜甫\n歲暮陰陽催短景，天涯霜雪霽寒宵。\n五更鼓角聲悲壯，三峽星河影動搖。\n野哭幾家聞戰伐，夷歌數處起漁樵。\n臥龍躍馬終黃土，人事依依漫寂寥。", "title": "閣夜", "author": "杜甫", "paragraphs": ["歲暮陰陽催短景，天涯霜雪霽寒宵。", "五更鼓角聲悲壯，三峽星河影動搖。", "野哭幾家聞戰伐，夷歌數處起漁樵。", "臥龍躍馬終黃土，人事依依漫寂寥。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 222, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "8402773be290a175d65d77dedeeef9aaefd6ef475e02002703842d4204c7f043", "family": "59dc31d45fc2864f093f801f9b7c7d97c3a552e436d025c2777494490e085662"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-a2b4fe60-9809-422d-afa7-143a2088f045", "text": "闕題\n劉眘虛\n道由白雲盡，春與青溪長。\n時有落花至，遠隨流水香。\n閑門向山路，深柳讀書堂。\n幽映每白日，清輝照衣裳。", "title": "闕題", "author": "劉眘虛", "paragraphs": ["道由白雲盡，春與青溪長。", "時有落花至，遠隨流水香。", "閑門向山路，深柳讀書堂。", "幽映每白日，清輝照衣裳。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "春天", "写景", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 362, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "e9a3aa13957b3a40b20c25ba58cb9e9679ce59e86acfab7882a8d1e4b122eb21", "family": "0f5e81d3342b20deec7d831b9a6df00aca6fba476b10e7e66db9b1853302f4f8"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-9da0cbe5-52d4-4efc-8be2-2f78f1a8f097", "text": "客至\n杜甫\n舍南舍北皆春水，但見羣鷗日日來。\n花徑不曾緣客掃，蓬門今始爲君開。\n盤餐市遠無兼味，樽酒家貧只舊醅。\n肯與鄰翁相對飲，隔籬呼取盡餘桮。", "title": "客至", "author": "杜甫", "paragraphs": ["舍南舍北皆春水，但見羣鷗日日來。", "花徑不曾緣客掃，蓬門今始爲君開。", "盤餐市遠無兼味，樽酒家貧只舊醅。", "肯與鄰翁相對飲，隔籬呼取盡餘桮。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "喜悦", "写景", "友情", "待客"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 213, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "0ad85df737db4ae306bb5b1a65fa5aec76a42fa5ea64edd197be72aa40400070", "family": "18909d88d61cddec76cfd065dd412e6a3d674fb012fa33d336fd4fe4ca1fc9ab"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-a1824eb8-4e2e-4d53-9a33-e1dcfe7d1c73", "text": "經鄒魯祭孔子而歎之\n明皇帝\n夫子何爲者？栖栖一代中。\n地猶鄹氏邑，宅即魯王宮。\n歎鳳嗟身否，傷麟怨道窮。\n今看兩楹奠，當與夢時同。", "title": "經鄒魯祭孔子而歎之", "author": "明皇帝", "paragraphs": ["夫子何爲者？栖栖一代中。", "地猶鄹氏邑，宅即魯王宮。", "歎鳳嗟身否，傷麟怨道窮。", "今看兩楹奠，當與夢時同。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "伤怀", "写人", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 2, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "b08e1c27ee0f31c40c16317dab333af9e4f59548fe3bd2fbe7d60a924c4cd55f", "family": "4be479f5eaacdda8dc3825a41c5b724cff534609954981f58130168d13418a35"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-d7c6d072-6e84-482e-856a-5a4c21226a3c", "text": "樂遊原\n李商隱\n向晚意不適，驅車登古原。\n夕陽無限好，只是近黃昏。", "title": "樂遊原", "author": "李商隱", "paragraphs": ["向晚意不適，驅車登古原。", "夕陽無限好，只是近黃昏。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "惜时", "哲理"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 11, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "e5c73f07f1cb4c00a8327af9f7f0f4007b055be12d00cf6aab075c6abec58a0e", "family": "d0a38e235db88f0868d46350acdba0b57dde2365bc046a528cc5c07936f8133c"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-bd7949f8-c961-4bfd-a307-1fe9e621028c", "text": "哀王孫\n杜甫\n長安城頭頭白烏，夜飛延秋門上呼。\n又向人家啄大屋，屋底達官走避胡。\n金鞭斷折九馬死，骨肉不待同馳驅。\n腰下實玦青珊瑚，可憐王孫泣路隅。\n問之不肯道姓名，但道困苦乞爲奴。\n已經百日竄荆棘，身上無有完肌膚。\n高帝子孫盡隆準，龍種自與常人殊。\n豺狼在邑龍在野，王孫善保千金軀。\n不敢長語臨交衢，且爲王孫立斯須。\n昨夜東風吹血腥，東來橐駝滿舊都。\n朔方健兒好身手，昔何勇銳今何愚。\n竊聞天子已傳位，賢德北服南單于。\n花門剺面請雪恥，慎勿出口他人狙。\n哀哉王孫慎勿疎，五陵佳氣無時無。", "title": "哀王孫", "author": "杜甫", "paragraphs": ["長安城頭頭白烏，夜飛延秋門上呼。", "又向人家啄大屋，屋底達官走避胡。", "金鞭斷折九馬死，骨肉不待同馳驅。", "腰下實玦青珊瑚，可憐王孫泣路隅。", "問之不肯道姓名，但道困苦乞爲奴。", "已經百日竄荆棘，身上無有完肌膚。", "高帝子孫盡隆準，龍種自與常人殊。", "豺狼在邑龍在野，王孫善保千金軀。", "不敢長語臨交衢，且爲王孫立斯須。", "昨夜東風吹血腥，東來橐駝滿舊都。", "朔方健兒好身手，昔何勇銳今何愚。", "竊聞天子已傳位，賢德北服南單于。", "花門剺面請雪恥，慎勿出口他人狙。", "哀哉王孫慎勿疎，五陵佳氣無時無。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "叙事", "抒情", "新乐府辞", "乐府", "写鸟", "鸟"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 245, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "31b185371800d2010579019a1f37eb11977d30fabd62fc830bc0b59e146b1eff", "family": "8ee97a75704aa8edd3e87a9acb609c1f3eacd8bba8a96bb782f1d23fb342d6b5"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-ce491725-b96b-46a7-b83c-463d2094ef3f", "text": "和張僕射塞下曲 一\n盧綸\n鷲翎金僕姑，燕尾繡蝥弧。\n獨立揚新令，千營共一呼。", "title": "和張僕射塞下曲 一", "author": "盧綸", "paragraphs": ["鷲翎金僕姑，燕尾繡蝥弧。", "獨立揚新令，千營共一呼。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "将军", "乐府", "高中古诗", "边塞", "赞美"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 126, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "28184caf0ab0c1d1925ff0fad80a2de5bf152d929784960aae74a40f93895e9e", "family": "6ef50fe401e9959a4c72f7836d6293f41e579ed8c2756b1fcba786d80db0ab58"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-92ae04dc-89af-45d6-9e31-204a01df801d", "text": "遣懷\n杜牧\n落魄江南載酒行，楚腰腸斷掌中輕。\n十年一覺揚州夢，贏得青樓薄倖名。", "title": "遣懷", "author": "杜牧", "paragraphs": ["落魄江南載酒行，楚腰腸斷掌中輕。", "十年一覺揚州夢，贏得青樓薄倖名。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "七言绝句", "抒怀"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 76, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "7f1951f445fbf91e2dabbe61e6274ba1de2d93606db94049ff9ef1ea258dbcb1", "family": "c757751ac3e7b56a18ad0b4ca731da621abbbd352f908a319d91ef3a620a4a61"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-9d1b6a18-571c-4f25-bfdb-3fe260115c3f", "text": "贈孟浩然\n李白\n吾愛孟夫子，風流天下聞。\n紅顏棄軒冕，白首臥松雲。\n醉月頻中聖，迷花不事君。\n高山安可仰，徒此揖清芬。", "title": "贈孟浩然", "author": "李白", "paragraphs": ["吾愛孟夫子，風流天下聞。", "紅顏棄軒冕，白首臥松雲。", "醉月頻中聖，迷花不事君。", "高山安可仰，徒此揖清芬。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "赠别", "五言律诗", "敬爱"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 316, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "b539b108324f4d2ab193d308344b466ebbaca0339a8da73812317e82170d52aa", "family": "1fe31ac51122cc5122daf2b44feec23ca23b9eac02484c79d6fb8b1119dc13ae"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-b1dad78c-4dd8-4b99-b37b-741ed761f26a", "text": "宿桐廬江寄廣陵舊遊\n孟浩然\n山暝聞猿愁，滄江急夜流。\n風鳴兩岸葉，月照一孤舟。\n建德非吾土，維揚憶舊遊。\n還將兩行淚，遙寄海西頭。", "title": "宿桐廬江寄廣陵舊遊", "author": "孟浩然", "paragraphs": ["山暝聞猿愁，滄江急夜流。", "風鳴兩岸葉，月照一孤舟。", "建德非吾土，維揚憶舊遊。", "還將兩行淚，遙寄海西頭。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "描写水", "五言律诗", "怀人", "写水"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 112, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "896e545e22dd4f6dad5f5ca5cd54fd4f8f5b24d6fff918092fd49af2d81422bb", "family": "9482eb2666899b8ae418c7f7bdb638c34c77021d6347d32f04739e786710b9db"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-efaaa86e-5628-40d3-a137-1ae8fcbe41b8", "text": "新嫁娘詞三首 三\n王建\n三日入廚下，洗手作羹湯。\n未諳姑食性，先遣小姑嘗。", "title": "新嫁娘詞三首 三", "author": "王建", "paragraphs": ["三日入廚下，洗手作羹湯。", "未諳姑食性，先遣小姑嘗。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "新婚", "五言绝句", "女子", "生活"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 7, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "e0afbefbf12e1bab1403af040106a2ceb2dde8adb90a9887857de308c9409f37", "family": "3834957a4aa4ebde253ed2905310c534560464f536f560535c3cb8473b11aeca"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-02456f60-6ab5-4de8-b9ed-f7519818f0ca", "text": "賈生\n李商隱\n宣室求賢訪逐臣，賈生才調更無倫。\n可憐夜半虛前席，不問蒼生問鬼神。", "title": "賈生", "author": "李商隱", "paragraphs": ["宣室求賢訪逐臣，賈生才調更無倫。", "可憐夜半虛前席，不問蒼生問鬼神。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "隋・唐・五代", "托古讽今", "七言绝句", "怀才不遇"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 30, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "1a662b6dc3f6102447fa7c1c912d6b85f26f6528d2f590992ec62527454ff264", "family": "c1e09f74dbec6976579a41f0586dc92b5aeb2e5a162fb243ea11c9814ae44c33"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-a8617715-ad59-4da8-8071-e9aeb1760e6a", "text": "雜曲歌辭 金縷衣\n不詳\n勸君莫惜金縷衣，勸君惜取少年時。\n花開堪折直須折，莫待無花空折枝。", "title": "雜曲歌辭 金縷衣", "author": "不詳", "paragraphs": ["勸君莫惜金縷衣，勸君惜取少年時。", "花開堪折直須折，莫待無花空折枝。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "惜时", "励志", "乐府"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 261, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "db3f188f5f80f07be27a4e0de756416286b5a068d2b41b66d758221ca7ee7bff", "family": "abfa33bb24e2fada991ff5ebd1202c27b4c69958b0d112ed80034108d6db8a5a"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-6290b8f0-48de-407f-be2c-629140d91f83", "text": "春泛若耶溪\n綦毋潛\n幽意無斷絕，此去隨所偶。\n晚風吹行舟，花路入溪口。\n際夜轉西壑，隔山望南斗。\n潭煙飛溶溶，林月低向後。\n生事且彌漫，願爲持竿叟。", "title": "春泛若耶溪", "author": "綦毋潛", "paragraphs": ["幽意無斷絕，此去隨所偶。", "晚風吹行舟，花路入溪口。", "際夜轉西壑，隔山望南斗。", "潭煙飛溶溶，林月低向後。", "生事且彌漫，願爲持竿叟。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "抒情", "五言古诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 164, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "69dddf26b700848494c0d47a22f9ef3fec414a61c58eec4dfd383c44af833f77", "family": "0ef52821e028787734935a98d51aa16b55ec4c8300b81937ef6f49d6d236a826"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-87f5949b-bdad-4b5e-b488-7015bd45cc4f", "text": "詠懷古跡五首 五\n杜甫\n諸葛大名垂宇宙，宗臣遺像肅清高。\n三分割據紆籌策，萬古雲霄一羽毛。\n伯仲之間見伊呂，指揮若定失蕭曹。\n福移漢祚難恢復，志決身殲軍務勞。", "title": "詠懷古跡五首 五", "author": "杜甫", "paragraphs": ["諸葛大名垂宇宙，宗臣遺像肅清高。", "三分割據紆籌策，萬古雲霄一羽毛。", "伯仲之間見伊呂，指揮若定失蕭曹。", "福移漢祚難恢復，志決身殲軍務勞。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "隋・唐・五代", "七言律诗", "怀古", "议论"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 228, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "e75c6c15d112c6edcaf500635ee3c342fe09ea75642d11f82753d23e9ad98de9", "family": "61ad3be4883edb4db7c1d43e0451e7d5109b930b6c16ac4824b8947ffddc5fac"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-7277c420-9f3f-4093-a5b2-6331494721e8", "text": "春思\n李白\n燕草如碧絲，秦桑低綠枝。\n當君懷歸日，是妾斷腸時。\n春風不相識，何事入羅幃。", "title": "春思", "author": "李白", "paragraphs": ["燕草如碧絲，秦桑低綠枝。", "當君懷歸日，是妾斷腸時。", "春風不相識，何事入羅幃。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "思念", "五言古诗", "春天", "坚贞", "妇女"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 311, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "d1cf7bab94386785ee68df7c33bd8693c8739d9adefa0be8f387125dc72a8837", "family": "dade70ea896b63e790ba13a7084653e71d0c2535a1e9dfeba747a5a7062e874f"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-afc2e6d6-e67f-4513-a6ab-82841d2f97cc", "text": "寄人 一\n張泌\n別夢依依到謝家，小廊迴合曲闌斜。\n多情只有春庭月，猶爲離人照落花。", "title": "寄人 一", "author": "張泌", "paragraphs": ["別夢依依到謝家，小廊迴合曲闌斜。", "多情只有春庭月，猶爲離人照落花。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "思念", "七言绝句", "月亮", "爱情"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 82, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "0b0985a5ae5fbb6d2a9d28ccfd709ad27d0c4c57c81f9ff717c1047e66aff1e9", "family": "89b7cad383712a08f37589462b65200bba216556cb096766db7bec5466ef5c3b"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-d755f74b-18fd-44d1-a6e1-43e77490bb09", "text": "喜見外弟又言別\n李益\n十年離亂後，長大一相逢。\n問姓驚初見，稱名憶舊容。\n別來滄海事，語罷暮天鐘。\n明日巴陵道，秋山又幾重。", "title": "喜見外弟又言別", "author": "李益", "paragraphs": ["十年離亂後，長大一相逢。", "問姓驚初見，稱名憶舊容。", "別來滄海事，語罷暮天鐘。", "明日巴陵道，秋山又幾重。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "离别", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 86, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "13e0bd7e9eb7749bfa882b93f9b97426e9f209800755dc091ec06c7934feb524", "family": "8dbaf14f2724a59c802d341e5922cfab694004721b8d0c4bcc98f0ef0939afb7"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-71999aa1-55dd-4449-81b0-41f04686bf2e", "text": "聽蜀僧濬彈琴\n李白\n蜀僧抱綠綺，西下峨眉峰。\n爲我一揮手，如聽萬壑松。\n客心洗流水，餘響入霜鐘。\n不覺碧山暮，秋雲暗幾重。", "title": "聽蜀僧濬彈琴", "author": "李白", "paragraphs": ["蜀僧抱綠綺，西下峨眉峰。", "爲我一揮手，如聽萬壑松。", "客心洗流水，餘響入霜鐘。", "不覺碧山暮，秋雲暗幾重。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "音乐", "五言律诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 329, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "3ebee138aba5d1ae39adf5ba97f30406f91c3bcb318ad0f945bf792ce7bbbcc9", "family": "2736162d56e403bdd2bbbbfa0e0643b8653f0338882e853315b58f1641db3a2e"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-d32a2610-09d7-49ad-8cdf-dd9c649144c7", "text": "風雨\n李商隱\n淒涼寶劍篇，羈泊欲窮年。\n黃葉仍風雨，青樓自管絃。\n新知遭薄俗，舊好隔良緣。\n心斷新豐酒，銷愁斗幾千。", "title": "風雨", "author": "李商隱", "paragraphs": ["淒涼寶劍篇，羈泊欲窮年。", "黃葉仍風雨，青樓自管絃。", "新知遭薄俗，舊好隔良緣。", "心斷新豐酒，銷愁斗幾千。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "风雨", "五言律诗", "怀才不遇"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 14, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "50d78ca90c39342c31e386db85b8ae0c1d6c34bb8e5ebf5133feccb48f4d6b8b", "family": "948d80a8d94cc54d2550b4adcb8dc4dd6f9ce54c87aa58849fb87cb95eff1b6b"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-cb168b3b-d104-4df7-9868-1e1225ddb941", "text": "春曉\n孟浩然\n春眠不覺曉，處處聞啼鳥。\n夜來風雨聲，花落知多少。", "title": "春曉", "author": "孟浩然", "paragraphs": ["春眠不覺曉，處處聞啼鳥。", "夜來風雨聲，花落知多少。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "春", "写景", "一年级下册", "惜春", "五言绝句", "小学古诗"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 120, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "0f55c3d1a44e73336886cd187aad631f1d97e68a49831788254cd4cc35b5749e", "family": "f4a9136d05fe388e36c8334256b8fa9c0684916beb6631054960906aad48c2f9"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-4e491c2f-c3c8-487f-8e76-63bd0a811b30", "text": "廬山謠寄盧侍御虛舟\n李白\n我本楚狂人，鳳歌笑孔丘。\n手持綠玉杖，朝別黃鶴樓。\n五嶽尋仙不辭遠，一生好入名山遊。\n廬山秀出南斗傍，屏風九疊雲錦張，影落明湖青黛光。\n金闕前開二峰長，銀河倒挂三石梁。\n香爐瀑布遙相望，迴厓沓嶂凌蒼蒼。\n翠影紅霞映朝日，鳥飛不到吳天長。\n登高壯觀天地間，大江茫茫去不還。\n黃雲萬里動風色，白波九道流雪山。\n好爲廬山謠，興因廬山發。\n閑窺石鏡清我心，謝公行處蒼苔沒。\n早服還丹無世情，琴心三疊道初成。\n遙見仙人綵雲裏，手把芙蓉朝玉京。\n先期汗漫九垓上，願接盧敖遊太清。", "title": "廬山謠寄盧侍御虛舟", "author": "李白", "paragraphs": ["我本楚狂人，鳳歌笑孔丘。", "手持綠玉杖，朝別黃鶴樓。", "五嶽尋仙不辭遠，一生好入名山遊。", "廬山秀出南斗傍，屏風九疊雲錦張，影落明湖青黛光。", "金闕前開二峰長，銀河倒挂三石梁。", "香爐瀑布遙相望，迴厓沓嶂凌蒼蒼。", "翠影紅霞映朝日，鳥飛不到吳天長。", "登高壯觀天地間，大江茫茫去不還。", "黃雲萬里動風色，白波九道流雪山。", "好爲廬山謠，興因廬山發。", "閑窺石鏡清我心，謝公行處蒼苔沒。", "早服還丹無世情，琴心三疊道初成。", "遙見仙人綵雲裏，手把芙蓉朝玉京。", "先期汗漫九垓上，願接盧敖遊太清。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "庐山", "黄鹤楼", "写景", "归隐", "七言古诗", "山水"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 317, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "f94128d5a563f7c63885142eb9d1160f3bc1385614b12711255bf572a2192e98", "family": "faaff3b8261ba4fbb0cc952b5eb4fbfd335a55f2abde005acca8236531b86002"}
{"id": "chinese-poetry-tang300-d35f583a-c20c-453c-a886-e13f98b2e4b4", "text": "春思\n皇甫冉\n鶯啼燕語報新年，馬邑龍堆路幾千。\n家住秦城鄰漢苑，心隨明月到胡天。\n機中錦字論長恨，樓上花枝笑獨眠。\n爲問元戎竇車騎，何時反斾勒燕然。", "title": "春思", "author": "皇甫冉", "paragraphs": ["鶯啼燕語報新年，馬邑龍堆路幾千。", "家住秦城鄰漢苑，心隨明月到胡天。", "機中錦字論長恨，樓上花枝笑獨眠。", "爲問元戎竇車騎，何時反斾勒燕然。"], "tags": ["唐诗三百首", "思念", "七言律诗", "春天", "妇女", "闺怨"], "split": "train", "source_split": "unpartitioned", "source_record_index": 357, "source": "chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry", "source_revision": "b8594f81a89752241442f2ce267d6f66f96704ee", "language": "lzh", "script": "traditional Chinese as published; no script conversion", "license": "MIT", "text_sha256": "1fd9c07ae44b268d1c7fee2d1cbc0de1df89fb4a7131be1895cbad9824d66462", "family": "8626b78fa8c4e5ee7f2d6c821a392a2bd33db7f0efdbabeb6eda123884174594"}
